  m_text: 'A determined individual, the Marauder has dedicated his eternity to re-claiming
    his death.


    Hell-bent on gaining any semblance of peace, he will stop at
    nothing to finding the Scientist responsible for it all.


    But that''s not
    his main goal.


    He will find Life.


    He will kill her.'
